<title>USA: USAir to change name, corporate identity.</title>
<headline>USAir to change name, corporate identity.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>USAir Inc said on Tuesday that it will announce a change in its name and corporate identity at its scheduled press conference at 1200 EST.</p>
<p>The airline would not reveal its new name or any further details in its statement.</p>
</text>
